1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:02,540
2,156 dead.

2
00:00:03,290 --> 00:00:07,100
And you are responsible
for every single one of them.

3
00:00:08,290 --> 00:00:09,820
How could you let that happen?

4
00:00:10,470 --> 00:00:11,610
I had a choice to make.

5
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:12,690
I made it.

6
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:14,190
I had to keep my cover.

7
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:16,160
I needed Dufraisne's trust.

8
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:18,240
Then he sent you to Russia.

9
00:00:18,910 --> 00:00:20,360
He needed a tanker.

10
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:21,840
Didn't say why.

11
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:25,370
A smuggling ship was trapped
in the ice in the Sea of Okhotsk.

12
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:28,760
They dropped me in to clear the area
and secure the tanker for them.

13
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:31,900
I never want to see another ship again.
